OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElisabeth Leonskaja plays Liszt,
OL,6,     Gthe Van Kuijk Quartet perform
OL,7,     GMendelssohn's String Quartet
OL,8,     GNo.1, and there's Dvorak,
OL,9,     GBacewicz and Prokofiev ballet
OL,10,     Gmusic from The Ulster Orchestra.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GFrom Guildford Cathedral, with
OL,13,     Gmusic by Robert Walker, Dyson,
OL,14,     GMelissa Dunphy and Francis Pott.
OL,15,G1600FComposer of the Week: Chopin
OL,16,     GChopin and his lover George Sand
OL,17,     Gescape the prying eyes of Paris.
OL,18,     GWith Donald Macleod.
OL,19,G1700FIn Tune
OL,20,     GConductor Daniela Candillari on
OL,21,     Gher London Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,22,     Gdebut.
